It is Tuesday evening and I come back home from the gym.
I am very tired.
Often after the gym, I sit on the sofa.
I usually read a good book and relax.
But this evening I have to do a very boring task.
I have to update my water and electricity account information.
I usually put off such tasks for later.
But today I have to finish this task at any cost.
It often takes a lot of time on government websites.
Therefore, before starting the work, I make a cup of tea.
I bring the tea to the table and sit on the chair.
I take out my phone and open the website.
It is raining heavily outside.
Often in bad weather, the internet runs slowly.
But today I just have to update my account.
I take a deep breath and start my work.
